# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31899> (nemonapride)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31899> "A racemate composed of (2<i>S</i>,3<i>S</i>)- and (2<i>R</i>,3<i>R</i>)-enantiomers of nemonapride. Highly potent dopamine D<small><sub>2</sub></small>-like receptor antagonist; selective over D<small><sub>1</sub></small>-like receptors (Ki values are 0.1 and 740 nM for D<small><sub>2</sub></small>-like and D<small><sub>1</sub></small>-like receptors respectively). Also potent 5-HT<small><sub>1A</sub></small> receptor agonist (IC<small><sub>50</sub></small> = 34 nM) and has affinity for sigma receptors.")
