AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/chebi/3_STAR>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35493> "antipyretic")
